WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.120
Summer vacation's looking bright!

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:09.090
Lala and Mireille have been getting a bunch of likes from everyone!

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.180
And would you look at that, our idol ranks leveled up!

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.380
Wow!

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.230
A new dressing room!

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:55.840
And it's all ours!

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.960
Good job-kuma! Ya finally ranked up-kuma!

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.550
Yeah! We did it!

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.970
Once again, just as my calculations predicted.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.080
Take a look at this-kuma.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:13.620
We have use of this place thanks to Mireille ranking up from "Idol Egg" to "Hatchling Idol".

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:18.670
And Lala made it from "Sparkling New Student" to "Good Student".

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.030
Capisce!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.740
However, as you can see, you've still got a ways to go.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:27.250
We'll use our summer vacation to keep climbing up-pri!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.190
Take a look at this-kuma.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:34.840
You were included in PriPara Magazine's article on the latest noteworthy idols!

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.660
Amazing!

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.600
"These are the hottest new teams this month."

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.730
That's it? We're just one of a bunch teams on this list.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.230
Of course you are-kuma!

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.690
You're not even an itty bitty <i>bit</i> bigger than that yet-kuma!

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:56.210
You need to practice more and more and more!

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.150
Keep on gettin' those gigs-kuma!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.870
Wow, it's Sophie! She's so cool!

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:09.680
I wonder if she'll work with us now.

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:13.350
I'm sure we'd be the best team ever if she did.

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:14.840
You're still going on about that-kuma?
You're still going on about that-pri?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.050
But no other options really feel like they'd work.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.890
Well, how about I sign you up for an event Sophie's in too-kuma?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.010
What, we can get into the same events?

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:30.050
Yeah, now that Mireille's in a higher class.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.250
Really? Thanks Mireille!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.230
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go...

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.030
Better that she notices the difference in ability soon and gives up-pri.

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.200
I really can't keep up with these childish delusions of hers.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.160
Let's go!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.580
It's Lala and Mireille!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.070
Can I get an autograph?

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.540
Me too! Me too!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.750
Oh, the pleasure is ours-pri!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.710
Lala!

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.760
Eiko!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.320
So you ranked up! Congrats!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.170
Thanks!

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.550
Keep on doing your best, Lala!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.150
I'll be cheering you on!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.440
These two became your fans too!

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:09.460
Keep it up.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:11.640
I can't wait for your next event.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:14.630
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.320
It's great having supportive fans.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.480
We owe them a lot-pri.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.460
What's going on there? That's a lot of people!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.610
Sophie's fans-pri.

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.490
What? That many?

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:33.110
Sophie's concert just ended, so everyone's waiting for her outside the venue.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.360
Her numbers are in a totally different league from ours-pri.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:37.710
Where'd you go, Lala?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:42.640
C'mon, Mireille! Let's go say hi to Sophie!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.760
What? Say hi? Geez.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.170
Well, I guess it'd be fine to say hi.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.710
I wanna see her up close too!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:55.350
Excellent work, Sophie. Another wonderful performance.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.230
It was nothing special.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:01.260
Pshu...

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:05.240
No no no no! We can't have Sophie going into Fancy Mode out here!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.450
Quickly! To the dressing room!

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.500
Gotchanko!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.290
Red Flash...

00:05:17.260 --> 00:05:18.700
That was close...

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.800
I'm so glad no one saw us-usa.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.650
If someone found out her overflowing genius sometimes makes her turn all gooey—

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:29.010
I mean, makes her go into Fancy Mode...

00:05:29.730 --> 00:05:33.100
That she's actually extremely frail and has absolutely no sense of direction...

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:36.330
And how completely removed from reality she is...

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:39.070
That she can't even take care of her hair by herself!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.390
If people found that stuff out...

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.860
Pshu...

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.260
This boneless glob is your top star?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:49.600
Does she get superpowers from pickled plums or something?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:51.950
That's ridiculous! You're an idiot, Usagi!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.790
That's so going to be a scandal-usa!

00:05:55.190 --> 00:06:00.080
On my honor—no, your honor, Sophie, I swear!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:05.120
I will keep the secret of Fancy Mode from the world, no matter the cost!

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:07.260
Don't worry, Manager!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:11.470
You have the full support of Lady Sophie's Royal Guard!

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:16.520
W-W-Who is it? No entry-usa!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.250
No entry-usa!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:25.470
Hello! Sophie?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.110
Pipe down!

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.830
Good lord, stop making such a ruckus-usa!

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.740
Can't you read-usa?

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:37.290
K, O, uh...

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:41.000
Keep out-usa! It means you can't come in-usa.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.660
Oh, that's what that means!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.710
Now that you know, get out of here-usa!

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:49.100
But we just wanted to say hi to Sophie.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.680
Huh? Say hi?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.080
We also made it into Debut Class,

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:56.780
so we figured we'd come meet Sophie!

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:58.640
Hmm, Lala and Mireille?

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:03.110
Oh, you're Kuma's new idols-usa?

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.770
You've heard of us-pri?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.570
Bunny ears are long! They hear all.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.280
That's good. So you won't mind if we come in?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.650
Well, now that I know you work with Kuma...

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.240
I'll have to be extra careful to keep you away from her-usa!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:22.380
Good grief, these new idols...

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.920
Lady Sophie, here is your Red Flash!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:31.300
Hello again.

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:34.080
Welcome back, Lady Sophie.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:34.980
Chanko!

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.580
Welcome back!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:39.310
Papa's Pasta

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.710
Here's your peperoncino.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.270
Thanks, Lala!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.980
Cookatello.

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.940
Lala, take these to table 3!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.400
Capisce!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.750
Enjoy!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:58.540
Headmistress?!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:02.430
I can't get enough of the food here.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:03.120
Oh?

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:08.650
PriPara! I can smell PriPara!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:09.960
Manaka!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.430
Could you have...

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:19.450
Here you go! Gorgonzola pizza, large and in charge!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:23.710
Ohh! The fragrant scent of pizza!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:25.560
This looks fantastic! This is just what I needed!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:27.020
Don't mind if I do!

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:29.980
I managed to distract her.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.700
This is excellent!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.760
I should come here every day!

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:42.710
Whaaat? Here I thought I wouldn't have to deal with her over summer vacation...

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:43.940
I hate it!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.350
I hate all this stupidly delicious food!

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:49.420
What? Is my cooking that badricciosa?

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.340
No, your cooking's the best.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.890
I'm glad it makes the cut. The pizza cut.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.590
The cut, the pizza cut. The pizzacut!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:01.560
Oh, what? It's already 2?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.760
I almost forgot! I need to hurry to PriPara!

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.150
PriPara?

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.070
You said PriPara just now, did you not?

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.120
Yes, I heard you loud and clear!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.300
Uh, no, I mean...

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:21.080
Right!

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:24.540
The pudding jalapeño pizza! I call it the PuddyPara pizza!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:29.760
And said even shorter it's just PuddyPara, which I was just thinking I should recommend to you.

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:32.160
It's one of our most popular recipes. Care to try it out?

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:34.220
Manaka!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:38.540
I'd like one of that, please.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.690
Capisce!

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:43.140
One pudding jalapeño pizza!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.350
Huh?

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.060
Crud, I'm gonna be late!

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.080
PriPara Change complete!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.920
And it's our first time performing in the same event as Sophie, too!

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.590
Mireille's gonna bite my head off!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:24.100
Huh? Er, are you okay?

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.070
Sorry.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.140
I totally tripped on you.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.500
Wait a minute, are you...

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:36.210
The pickled plum pizza person from room 3333!

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:39.450
Uh, do you recognize me? I'm Lala.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.770
I deliver pizza to your place sometimes.

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.530
Huh?

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:43.620
Oh, right.

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:45.350
That's me!

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.460
Red Flash...

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:51.980
Red? Oh...

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:54.940
Red Flash.

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:58.990
Oh yeah, she calls pickled plums "Red Flash".

00:10:58.990 --> 00:10:59.930
Red Flash!

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:04.560
Sorry, but I don't have any pickled plum pizza with me.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.500
What now?

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.030
Pshu...

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:16.070
Capisce! Don't worry, I'll find you some Red Flash!

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.030
Excuse me?

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.240
Does anyone have any pickled plums?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:23.740
I'm looking for pickled plums!
Does anyone have any on hand?

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:25.630
What's wrong with this girl?

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.160
Where's Lala-kuma?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:30.700
Dammit, every single time-kuma...

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.960
Seriously-pri.

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:37.250
Sophie isn't here! And she's up first!
Where could she have wandered off to?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.010
Chanko!

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.100
That's Lady Sophie's PriTicket bag!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.720
Her bag is here...

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.680
That means she's gone out without her Red Flash!

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:50.390
What if she's lying around in Fancy Mode somewhere?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:57.190
We must find Lady Sophie!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:58.280
Roger!

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.380
Pickled plums...

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:03.560
No one has any...

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:04.820
Pshu...

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.640
There's no convenience stores in here...

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.160
Oh, a butterfly!

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.190
What? Where? Hey...

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:18.520
Well, you can't very well see with your hair over your eyes.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:19.680
Stop!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.090
You can't see my face.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:23.970
Why?

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:29.930
Anyone who sees it will hate me.

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.880
Is that from a horror flick?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.120
Let's check the butterfly out together.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:35.970
Stop!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:57.910
So pretty!

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:03.810
You... You don't hate me?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.440
Why would I?

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:08.260
You're still the same old pickled plum pizza person.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.390
Oh yeah!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:11.410
One of the stores might have some!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.060
You look kinda like Houjou Sophie, the idol, you know.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:23.090
Excuse me, do you have any pickled plum crepes?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:27.570
Pickled plum crepe? We have all kinds of crepes, but I've never heard of that one.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.160
I see.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:29.990
Capisce!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.230
Pickled plum soft serve? I'm afraid we don't have any.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.290
Figures. Capisce!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:39.320
Excuse me, do you have any pickled—

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:39.950
No.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:40.790
Capisce!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:41.500
Pickled p—

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:42.170
No.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.170
Capisce!

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:43.410
Pick—

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:43.860
No.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:44.750
Capisce!

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:45.050
P—

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:45.720
No.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:46.630
Capisce!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.970
Pickled plums? Why would I?

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.120
Come on, let's go.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:51.480
Umm...

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:52.560
No.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.730
Pickled plums are pretty hard to come by here.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.330
The only choice I have now—

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:02.680
Lala! Found you-kuma!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.650
Your plum-hunt ends here-kuma!

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:08.290
This'll be your first time in the same event as Sophie!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:11.010
You have no time to be chewing the fat with strangers!

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.130
We need to go prepare-kuma!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.550
I really wanted to find some!

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:18.580
No.

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:20.880
Don't worry.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:26.620
Seeing you run around got me a bit fired up too.

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.510
Good luck with your performance.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:30.990
Yeah!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:33.930
Thanks!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.680
Caught her! Here she is!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.110
Late again-pri!

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.580
I'm sorry!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:40.100
Oh, what are these?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.070
Backstage lunch boxes-pri.

00:14:42.070 --> 00:14:43.730
The boons of debut class-kuma!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.970
Oh! I never thought I'd find one here!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.850
I'm just delivering this Red Flash!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.770
Hey! Wait up-kuma! Lala! Come ba—

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.830
Off the charts, as usual.

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.720
Here you go! Red Flash!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:13.930
Red... Flash.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.850
Here. Open wide!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.920
Made it in the nick of time!

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:26.070
Wh-What's going on here?

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.590
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.280
Please forget all about this.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.660
Here's some incentive to keep your mouth shut!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.160
Candy?

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:39.450
Lala, thank you.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.830
Sure thing, bye bye!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.840
That's that then.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.220
Mireille! Sorry!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:50.800
Finally here-kuma!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.460
You're lucky today Lala-pri.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:58.210
Sophie was up first and her show got delayed, so we've still got time.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:15:59.520
I'm saved!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.260
I was so worried-kuma!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:04.480
They woulda fired me if we canceled at the last minute-kuma!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:09.830
I'll forgive you this time, but if you're ever this late again I'll be pri pri bristling with rage!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.740
Mireille! I'm sorry.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.320
Sophie's show is starting-kuma.

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:46.920
She's amazing.

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.200
We'll become just like her!

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.110
Yeah!

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:54.390
Cyalume Change!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.670
We're up next!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:18.260
I'll be observing your first performance in the new class.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.850
Oh! Meganii-pri!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:24.380
Pleased to meet you, Lala. I'm Meganii.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.360
Pleased to meet you.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:32.930
Did you find my "Marble Make Up a-ha-ha!" to your liking?

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:33.820
Yes!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:35.340
That's good.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:39.110
You'll probably be seeing me occasionally from now on.

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.050
Now, good luck with your show.

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.870
Let's go all out today-pri!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:44.680
Yeah!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.250
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.510
You may also scan Friend Tickets from your friends.

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.930
Coord Change Start!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:03.500
The Wonderland Macaron Dress.

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:07.020
An excellent fit for the energetic and cute Lala.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.940
Wonderland Macaron Dress!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:16.140
And Mireille is going with the Wonderland Rabbit Dress.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.110
A good contrast of colors for the team.

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.950
Wonderland Rabbit Dress! Pri!

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.510
<i>Exciting Present For You.</i>

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:27.860
<i>I want to deliver the greatest show I can to everyone in the audience, just like I delivered that pickled plum!</i>

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.790
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.860
Twirly twirl!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:37.940
Exciting!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.630
Present For You!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:52.230
Cyalume Change!

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.830
Man! Good show-kuma!

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.360
Take a look-kuma! I've never gotten this many likes!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.250
Really? That's great!

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:41.760
Doing good! All as I calculated of course-pri.

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:48.430
Hmm, I guess they're just barely passable despite their affiliation with you-usa.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.970
Usagi! Quit it with the condescension-kuma!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:54.240
Don't get so full of yourself just because you're doing a bit well-kuma!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.030
You wanna fight? You wanna fight? Bring it! Bring it!

00:20:55.030 --> 00:20:57.410
In through one ear, out the other-usa.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.360
Good job.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.040
So-Sophie!?

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.670
I could really feel that "Exciting Present For You."

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:07.810
Thank you so much!

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:10.290
Whoa! She complimented us-pri!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.920
Please accept this.

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:17.560
Pripri! That's...

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:19.610
A Friend Ticket!

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.350
H-H-H-Here's mine.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.440
What's going on here-pri?

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:08.270
It's summer! Time to head to the pool!

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:10.660
I haven't been hanging out with Nao lately.

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:12.740
Lala, don't forget the show today.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:17.620
Oh yeah! I forgot that when I promised to go to the pool!

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.330
You'll just have to forget the pool plan.

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.590
No way! I can't do that! Nao is my friend!

00:23:23.590 --> 00:23:28.210
And I haven't even told her I'm an idol yet!

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.010
Next time:

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:32.080
Excitement! Summer! Swimsuits! Capisce At The Pool♪
